# All ticks/costs/automation remain actual source behavior, no new mechanics.
survival-set airHold 0
survival-set rack 0
survival-set crewTick 0
survival-set canisters 3
survival-set engineCondition 19
trace
# Foul air doubles newly scheduled worker durations. Engineer/filter hand/cook
# are chosen by real jobs and thresholds; cooker produces food on task ticks.
action Work under foul air
trace
action Food produced while jobs run
trace
# A busy worker cannot start medical care; a refused action spends nothing.
medical jax
trace
# Restoring clean air does not retroactively rescale an already scheduled job.
survival-set airHold 20
action Work after air recovery
trace
